{"id":"c2cf6ca1c5f8e481","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-n-equivalence.md","title":"n-等价","display":"df-n-equivalence — n-等价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-n-equivalence","aliases":["28-df-n-equivalence"],"display":"df-n-equivalence — n-等价","depends_on":["[[28-df-structure]]","[[28-df-satisfaction]]","[[28-df-quantifier-rank]]","[[28-df-sentence]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-n-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-n-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-n-equivalence — n-等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d82c10f45e77e524\" href=\"?note=d82c10f45e77e524\" title=\"28-df-satisfaction\">28-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8aa5997eb451f824\" href=\"?note=8aa5997eb451f824\" title=\"28-df-quantifier-rank\">28-df-quantifier-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"410d75338bdb9bb0\" href=\"?note=410d75338bdb9bb0\" title=\"28-df-sentence\">28-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-n-equivalence-—-n-等价-$\\equiv_n$\">df-n-equivalence — n-等价 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_n\">\\(\\equiv_n\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"410d75338bdb9bb0\" href=\"?note=410d75338bdb9bb0\" title=\"28-df-sentence\">28-df-sentence</a> 所采用的一阶签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d82c10f45e77e524\" href=\"?note=d82c10f45e77e524\" title=\"28-df-satisfaction\">28-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A}),\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{B})\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A}),\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{B})\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (自然数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (句子集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"410d75338bdb9bb0\" href=\"?note=410d75338bdb9bb0\" title=\"28-df-sentence\">28-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}\\)</span> (量化秩, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8aa5997eb451f824\" href=\"?note=8aa5997eb451f824\" title=\"28-df-quantifier-rank\">28-df-quantifier-rank</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\\equiv_n\\mathfrak{B}\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\to(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak{B}\\models\\varphi))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak{A}\\equiv_n\\mathfrak{B}\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\to(\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak{B}\\models\\varphi))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\equiv_n \\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\equiv_n \\mathfrak{B}\\)</span> : 两结构在量化秩<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>内等价</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源状态：本目录一阶语法与语义接口上的自足支撑定义；不将本地模型论包装冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-n-equivalence-—-n-等价-$\\equiv_n$","text":"df-n-equivalence — n-等价 $\\equiv_n$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"7046e83df52059de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d82c10f45e77e524","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"8aa5997eb451f824","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantifier-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"410d75338bdb9bb0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"410d75338bdb9bb0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[28-df-sentence]] 所采用的一阶签名；$\\models$ 采用 [[28-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d82c10f45e77e524","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[28-df-sentence]] 所采用的一阶签名；$\\models$ 采用 [[28-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"7046e83df52059de","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnch